+        Shortcut for :meth:`as_kwargs` for usage with API calls that take
+        ``caption`` as a parameter.
+
+        .. code-block:: python
+
+            entities = Text(...)
+            await message.answer_photo(**entities.as_caption_kwargs(), photo=phot)
